<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - ASE Test Ltd.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - ASE Test Ltd.</headline>
<dateline>LOS ANGELES 1997-07-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>Hambrecht &amp; Quist LLC raised estimates for ASE Test Ltd, an integrated circuit testing firm based in Taiwan.</p>
<p>-- In a statement said ASE's Malaysian testing facility continues to experience strong orders from its multinational customer base.</p>
<p>-- noted its Kaoshiung facility relocation is complete, and it is expected to add sufficient capacity through the end of the decade.</p>
<p>-- ASE Test shares were up 3/4 at 58-1/2 by mid-afternoon.</p>
</text>
